 "dataflow_chain": "per head (kv3_head_eighth x8): face buses (q/k/v beats, cfg from ectl/hroot) -> e0 hub (front_0) -> fronts e2/e4/e6 (823 b each from e0; c_in/e_in/lt_in/q_beat_in exchanged all-to-all among fronts, 551 b per pair) -> each front feeds its own stack (e0->e1 738 b, e2->e3 / e4->e5 / e6->e7 466 b, stin cr/dr point-to-point) -> stacks return gf/kp/kpv to e0 (gather, 272 b each from e3/e5/e7) -> e0 -> face. ft slots are die pass-through (registered stations, fixed by the plan); 0 internal core-core stations, so every core-core link is a direct unregistered hop with reach 405 um (12.1e).",
 "timing_critical_source": "no prior worst paths for these types (hg kits reached place only, hgi has no current GRT/STA DB, hgi_v6 FAIL@gen); critical pairs taken from the plan: 0 internal stations, so the direct links over the 405-um reach (e0<->e4/e6 823 b at 665/985 um, e0<->e3/e5/e7 gather 272 b at 639-1305 um) are the timing-critical set; rule held: no link may exceed max(405 um, its current length).",
